==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|spraulen|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|spreawlian|lang=ang}}. Compare North Frisian {{term|spraweli|lang=frr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/spɹɔːl/|lang=en}}
: {{rhymes|ɔːl|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/spɹɔl/|lang=en}}
* {{a|cot-caught}} {{IPA|/spɹɑl/|lang=en}}

